# Decision records

Read these records for design choices, alternatives and validation evidence. Each record explains the selected approach and its consequences. Use the status field to distinguish accepted decisions from proposals.

The records follow the architecture decision record format and the important technical decision template.

Architecture decision record reference: https://github.com/architecture-decision-record/architecture-decision-record
Template: https://github.com/architecture-decision-record/architecture-decision-record/tree/main/locales/en/templates/decision-record-template-for-important-technical-decisions
Status reference: https://github.com/architecture-decision-record/architecture-decision-record/tree/main/locales/en/templates/decision-record-template-by-michael-nygard

